              "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n\t<title>Boltpay Financial Planner API</title>\n\t<style>\n\t\tbody {\n\t\t\tfont-family: \"HK Grotesk\", Arial, sans-serif;\n\t\t\tmax-width: 900px;\n\t\t\tmargin: 48px auto;\n\t\t\tpadding: 0 20px;\n\t\t\tcolor: #172033;\n\t\t}\n\t\tcode {\n\t\t\tbackground: #f3f5f7;\n\t\t\tpadding: 3px 6px;\n\t\t\tborder-radius: 4px;\n\t\t}\n\t\ta {\n\t\t\tcolor: #0759c7;\n\t\t}\n\t</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\t<h1>Dynamic Individual Financial Planner – Boltpe </h1>\n\t<p>The API service is running.</p>\n\t<p>Swagger documentation: <a href=\"./apidocs/index.html\">/apidocs/</a></p>\n\t<p>Health check: <a href=\"./health\">/health</a></p>\n</body>\n</html>",
