ion. Allowed range 0-20%.\"\n        },\n        \"retirement_post_return\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"example\": 7.0,\n          \"minimum\": 0,\n          \"maximum\": 50,\n          \"description\": \"Optional return assumption. Allowed range 0-50%.\"\n        },\n        \"retirement_pre_return\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"example\": 12.0,\n          \"minimum\": 0,\n          \"maximum\": 50,\n          \"description\": \"Optional return assumption. Allowed range 0-50%.\"\n        },\n        \"risk_appetite\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"example\": \"medium\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"low\",\n            \"medium\",\n            \"high\"\n          ],\n          \"description\": \"Required. Risk appetite used by the BoltPe allocation engine.\"\n        },\n        \"selected_goals_json\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/definitions/models.SelectedGoalRequest\"\n          },\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"description\": \"Required. At least one goal. Each key must be unique and must match the BoltPe Goal Master key, label, type and timeline rules.\"\n        },\n        \"spouse_age\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"example\": 24,\n          \"description\": \"For married customers: required whole number >=18. Must be 0/empty when single.\"\n        },\n        \"spouse_income\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"example\": 0.0,\n          \"description\": \"For married customers: required numeric value >=0. Must be 0/empty when single.\"\n        },\n        \"wealth_inflation\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"example\": 6.0,\n          \"minimum\": 0,\n          \"maximum\": 20,\n          \"description\": \"Optional inflation assumption. Allowed range 0-20%.\"\n        },\n        \"wealth_lumpsum_return\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"example\": 10.0,\n